        <mxCell id="notes" value="Preparation permits prerequisite work; executable admission still has to follow.&lt;br&gt;Namespace and project are optional for concept-only requests; private visibility still needs explicit selection.&lt;br&gt;Resources requests carry authentication without graph / focus / transaction / cycle callbacks.&lt;br&gt;Supplier calls are bounded and shared within an attempt. Dashed arrow: unavailable supplier evidence." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#526376;" vertex="1" parent="1">
